Upstream-Name: compiz-plugin-staticdock
Source: https://github.com/nitrogl/compiz-plugin-staticdock

Files: *
Copyright: 2026 Roberto Metere <roberto@metere.it>
License: GPL-2+
Comment:
 This plugin keeps dock/panel windows out of the cube/rotate/expo
 transform and repainting them flat afterwards.
 Some ideas are taken from KDE effects and others from
 Mark Thomas's C implementation of static.c.
 This is an independent implementation against the 0.9.x
 GLScreenInterface/GLWindowInterface hooks.

